  shortDescription: 20% chance a fallen block is saved back to the queue.
  description: When a placed block topples off the screen, there is a 20% chance it is
    teleported back to the top of your queue instead of costing a life - no structural
    blocks are destroyed. Only the shape returns; it does not save a piece you drop off
    yourself.
